   "text": "Western Sydney University - Foundation - QS Apply\nSkip to main content\nHOMEPAGE\nAPPLICATIONS\nNOTIFICATIONS\nEK\nWestern Sydney University - Foundation\nSummary\nDegrees and Programs\nStudent Testimonials\nCommission\nViewer Access\nAny user can see this institution.\nDescription\nWestern Sydney University was ranked by the QS World University Rankings as 474th in the world, coming 26th in Australia and 5th in Sydney. In 2021, it was ranked in the top 300 in the world and 18th in Australia in the Times Higher Education World University Rankings.\nThe College is the official pathway provider into Western Sydney University for domestic and international students, and successfully completing one of the Academic Pathway Programs guarantees a place on a university degree.\nCRICOS Provider Code: 03663C.\nTimestamps\nUpdated\n05/05/2026 06:28\nby Eston Dalmeida\nCreated\n30/03/2026 09:39\nby Gunia Beniwal\nType\nPathway\nCountry\nAustralia\nYearly Fees\nMax: A$30,057.00\nMin: A$20,044.00\nInternational Students\nPercentage of International Students\n4%\n1,450 of 36,033 Total Students\nOverview\nBasic Details\nInstitution Details\nOwnership\nPublic\nProvider\nNAVITAS\nFounded Year\n1989\nCampus(es)\nSydney\nCountry\nAustralia\nExcluded Countries\nAustralia, Cuba, Iran, North Korea, Syria, United States\nPREMIUM INSTITUTION\n No\nContract Start Date\n27/03/2026\nContract End Date\n01/04/2029\nContract Entity\nQS Ltd\nContract Status\nActive\nContract Document Link(s)\nN/A\nImages\nImages\nAdditional Details\nAccommodation Details\nAccommodation available\nScholarship Offered\n-\nYouTube Video Link(s)\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=El5LlVYYjzM\nInternship Details\n-\nAdditional Information\n-",
